ransparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 w-[42px] h-[42px] rounded-[16.8px] bg-ds-bg-off shadow-[0px_2.52px_12.6px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"sr-only\">open navigation menu</span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 7h14M4 11h14M4 15h14\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></ul></header></nav><main class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center min-w-36\"><section class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-16\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mb-4\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/\">Payam</a><span class=\"mx-1.5\">/</span><span class=\"text-black/70\">Students</span></nav><h1 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[44px] font-semibold tracking-[-1px] leading-tight\">Handle your <span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald\">everyday needs</span> with Payam</h1><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Data for your coursework, essentials for your room and help with everyday tasks. Payam brings payments, local shopping and service requests together for your day.</p><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Choose what you need, review the price and details, and follow your payment, order or request in the app.</p><p class=\"text-black/40 text-[13px] mt-4\">Everyday uses for student life</p><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Ways to use Payam</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Airtime, data and bills</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Top up airtime and data or pay a supported household bill. Review the recipient and amount before confirming.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Local shopping</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Browse products and groceries from local sellers. Check prices, descriptions and available delivery or pickup options.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Practical help</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Explore cleaning, repairs, printing and other services. Tell a provider what you need and review the scope and quote.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Shared payments</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Explore SplitPay, Pay4Me and money requests for payments you coordinate with others.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mb-1.5\">Check the details</p><p class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-medium max-w-[760px]\">Review prices, fees, recipients and fulfilment details before confirming. Available options vary by location and provider.</p></div><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Everyday needs for campus life</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">A top-up, groceries or a service request — explore categories that fit your day. These are example uses, not live seller availability.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Payments</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/sweetmint-grunerlokka\">TV payments</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/twintea\">Food options</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/the-fragrance-of-the-heart-majorstuen\">Local groceries</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Groceries</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/bonbon-oslo\">Local groceries</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Explore Services</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/boulangerie-m-skoyen\">Household essentials</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/encore-kafe-and-konditori-oslo\">Cleaning requests</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Food</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Creative services</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-vika-osteria-di-mare\">Mamma Pizza Vika Osteria di Mare</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/haus-di-gusto\">Home repairs</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Services</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/johnny-rockets-storo\">Cleaning requests</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/sabrura-sticks-and-sushi-valkyrien\">Printing services</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/cafe-laundromat\">Printing services</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Food options</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Creative services</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-vika-osteria-di-mare\">Mamma Pizza Vika Osteria di Mare</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/haus-di-gusto\">Home repairs</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Check details in the app</span></li></ul></div></div><a class=\"inline-block mt-6 rounded-full bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\" href=\"/deals/oslo\">Explore Payam</a></section><section aria-label=\"Student FAQ\" class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] mb-5\">Student questions</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-[820px]\"><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>How can I use Payam as a student?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Use Payments for airtime, data and supported bills. Explore local shopping, groceries and services for the things you need during student life.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Where do I check prices and fees?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Check the price, fees and total in the app before confirming. Services may require a quote before the scope and price are agreed.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Can I coordinate payments with others?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Explore SplitPay, Pay4Me and money requests. Review the participants, amounts and status for the tool you choose.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>What can I explore on Payam?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Explore Payments, Food, Shopping, Grocery, Transport, Services, Health and Business. Options depend on location and participating providers.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Where can I get help?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Use Help in the app or contact support@payam.ng. Include the relevant reference, but never share your password or transaction PIN.</p></details></div></section></div></section><div class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm py-10 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1520px] px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[14px] lg:hidden\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden h-[620px]\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/reference/d972bdbf2cb31d3d.webp\"/><div class=\"relative z-[5] flex flex-col items-center gap-[20px] w-full pt-[23px]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 w-[140px] h-[48px]\"><img alt=\"Payam\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"989\" height=\"293\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/payam/logo.png\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center text-white gap-[12px]\"><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-1.68px] w-[330px]\" id=\"download\">Ready for an easier everyday?</h2><p class=\"text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.33] tracking-[-0.32px] w-[206px]\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Discover Payam</span> <!-- -->and get everyday things done!</p></div></div><img alt=\"Payam home screen concept\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1481\" height=\"3205\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"absolute z-[2] top-[41%] left-[8%] w-[84%]\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/payam/generated/hero-phone-v1.png\"/></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 w-full\"><a role=\"button\" target=\"_